com/di/media/images/dw/20200930/388042055160565760.jpeg/xMJgC4b9ybxrxSe6IBHBG0NZM98Ui81lk8vs85PL7PM\"/><figcaption>社交高手聊天的6大原則（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"社交高手聊天的6大原則（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200930/388042057303855104.jpeg/MWh3tksqA7g6FfgH1yMgsUuJk3_vI0hesWDoEbFg6BE\"/><figcaption>社交高手聊天的6大原則（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"社交高手聊天的6大原則（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200930/388042059744940032.jpeg/_aNI2nMki-ZpIG6qIVpjrHSrvdVDeQUvS0gsNUtILDU\"/><figcaption>社交高手聊天的6大原則（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"社交高手聊天的6大原則（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200930/388042062186024960.jpeg/-mt8rKHjU9Jr9fW8xU47EZVj3yJazh8pzY7G182Oxtc\"/><figcaption>社交高手聊天的6大原則（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"社交高手聊天的6大原則（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200930/388042064618721280.jpeg/1sB98FQh3tvaLmRoe-tXJZMgxeFrwWdXzzAFvc8wBb0\"/><figcaption>社交高手聊天的6大原則（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"社交高手聊天的6大原則（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200930/388042067173052416.jpeg/-r7svouC8j5ECbGSp9dBRIZFwc8kGfQl2QfFJdkHxSU\"/><figcaption>社交高手聊天的6大原則（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"社交高手聊天的6大原則（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200930/388042029273321472.jpeg/DbKnr3e0OxhfDxkHBNigwl6MA6DIt5SLgVOBNoFTgTY\"/><figcaption>社交高手聊天的6大原則（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><p>上班族怨「為何不能1號領薪」 會計曝遇假日成本：多付2.11%誰想扛</p><p>股票漲到想退休！他猶豫「還要上班嗎」 兩派網友掀論戰</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-28T05:34:17.060546+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1425,"images":51,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none"}}